Serialized slam_toolbox pose graphs land here (<name>.posegraph + <name>.data), plus
any nav2-style <name>.pgm + <name>.yaml written by /slam_toolbox/save_map.

This directory is tracked but its contents are not. It has to exist before saving:
boost serialization will not create it, and /slam_toolbox/serialize_map reports the
failure only as RESULT_FAILED_TO_WRITE_FILE.
